      "end": 4.193,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "卖农产品哈，我们大部分都晓得，都要么就是以重量，",
      "score": 0.1485,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1785,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1846,
        "sc_delta": -0.0061,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.125,
        "seg_cer": 0.095,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "晓得",
        "text_free": "买农产品，哈，我们大部分都晓得，都要嘛，就是以重量。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 4.193,
      "end": 8.2,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "要么就是以数量作为单位来卖嘛，比如好钱斤啊，好钱一枝。",
      "score": 0.1333,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0589,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0576,
        "sc_delta": 0.0013,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.292,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "要么就是以数量作为单位来买嘛，不要花钱进啊，花钱一。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 8.693,
      "end": 11.776,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "那么平乐呢，现在流行了不？它那个翻山，",
      "score": 0.3978,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.4792,
        "sc_logprob": -0.3858,
        "sc_delta": 0.0933,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.468,
        "seg_cer": 0.25,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "噻",
        "text_free": "那么平了呢？现在流行了不？他那个饭噻。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 11.776,
      "end": 15.416,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "它也不能斤卖，也不能什么卖，它是论亩来卖的。",
      "score": 0.1555,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0089,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0096,
        "sc_delta": -0.0007,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.158,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.333,
        "phon_examples": "斤/精",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "它也不能精卖，也不能什么卖，它是能某来卖的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 15.558,
      "end": 18.577,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "那这样子一搞，就打破了常规的销售方式了不？",
      "score": 0.0722,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0038,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0059,
        "sc_delta": -0.0021,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.158,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "那政策一搞，就打破了常规的销售方式了。不。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 18.619,
      "end": 21.853,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "给平乐的翻山，就销到全国各地，",
      "score": 0.5831,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.814,
        "sc_logprob": -0.7923,
        "sc_delta": 0.0217,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.851,
        "seg_cer": 0.308,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "给平乐的发展就小个全国各地。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 21.853,
      "end": 25.256,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "也带富了一方的老百姓。初秋的时节，",
      "score": 0.6854,
